{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24221","headline":"喜闲 · 白居易","name":"喜闲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧洒伊嵩下，优游黄绮间。\n未曾一日闷，已得六年闲。\n鱼鸟爲徒侣，烟霞是往还。\n伴僧禅闭目，迎客笑开颜。\n兴发宵游寺，慵时昼掩关。\n夜来风月好，悔不宿香山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}